<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Earth Observation Report: {{ plan.aoi.place }}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; max-width: 950px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 24px; background: #ffffff; }
    h1 { color: #0f172a; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    h2 { color: #1e3a8a; margin-top: 36px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 6px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 4px; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; margin-right: 6px; }
    .badge-sig { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    .summary-card { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 18px 22px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .sensitivity-card { background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
    th, td { text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    th { background: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 600; }
    .provenance { background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .caveats { background: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 0.92rem; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
    .footer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Natural-Language Satellite Image Analyst Report</h1>
  <p>
    <span class="badge">{{ plan.aoi.place }}</span>
    <span class="badge">{{ plan.task_type }}</span>
    <span class="badge badge-sig">{{ stats.significance | upper }}</span>
    <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; margin-left: 12px;">Generated {{ execution_time }} UTC</span>
  </p>
  
  <h2>1. Executive Summary & Findings</h2>
  <div class="summary-card">
    {{ narrative }}
  </div>

  <h2>2. Quantitative Change Findings</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Metric</th>
        <th>Baseline ({{ plan.period_a.year }})</th>
        <th>Comparison ({{ plan.period_b.year if plan.period_b else 'N/A' }})</th>
        <th>Delta</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Total Surface Water</strong></td>
        <td>{{ stats.total_water_period_a_ha }} ha</td>
        <td>{{ stats.total_water_period_b_ha }} ha</td>
        <td><strong>{{ "+" if stats.net_change_ha > 0 else "" }}{{ stats.net_change_ha }} ha ({{ "+" if stats.percent_change > 0 else "" }}{{ stats.percent_change }}%)</strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Gained Water (New)</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>{{ stats.gained_water_ha }} ha</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Lost Water (Receded)</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>{{ stats.lost_water_ha }} ha</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Persistent Water (Stable)</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>{{ stats.persistent_water_ha }} ha</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Observed Churn Ratio</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>{{ (stats.churn_ratio * 100) | round(2) }}%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Monitored Waterbodies (&ge; {{ plan.min_area_ha }} ha)</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>{{ stats.waterbody_count }} features</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  {% if stats.headline_1ha %}
  <p><strong>Headline Waterbodies (&ge; 1.0 ha):</strong> {{ stats.headline_1ha.count }} bodies | Baseline: {{ stats.headline_1ha.total_water_period_a_ha }} ha | Comparison: {{ stats.headline_1ha.total_water_period_b_ha }} ha | Net Change: {{ "+" if stats.headline_1ha.net_change_ha > 0 else "" }}{{ stats.headline_1ha.net_change_ha }} ha</p>
  {% endif %}

  <h2>3. Remote Sensing Methodology & Sensitivity</h2>
  {% if provenance.threshold_sensitivity %}
  <div class="sensitivity-card">
    <strong>Threshold Sensitivity Analysis (&plusmn;0.10 MNDWI):</strong><br>
    Tested Thresholds: [{{ provenance.threshold_sensitivity.threshold_low }}, {{ provenance.threshold_sensitivity.threshold_mid }}, {{ provenance.threshold_sensitivity.threshold_high }}]<br>
    Net Change Range: [{{ "+" if provenance.threshold_sensitivity.net_change_range_ha[0] > 0 else "" }}{{ provenance.threshold_sensitivity.net_change_range_ha[0] }} ha, {{ "+" if provenance.threshold_sensitivity.net_change_range_ha[1] > 0 else "" }}{{ provenance.threshold_sensitivity.net_change_range_ha[1] }} ha]<br>
    Sign Stability: {{ "Stable across thresholds" if not provenance.threshold_sensitivity.sign_flips else "SENSITIVE: Net change flips sign across perturbed thresholds" }}<br>
    <em>{{ provenance.threshold_sensitivity.summary }}</em>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="provenance">
    Target AOI Bounding Box (WGS84): {{ provenance.bbox }}<br>
    Equal-Area Projection: {{ provenance.crs }} (10m GSD)<br>
    Spectral Index: Modified Normalized Difference Water Index (MNDWI)<br>
    Thresholds: Baseline = {{ provenance.period_a.threshold }}, Comparison = {{ provenance.period_b.threshold if provenance.period_b else 'N/A' }}<br>
    Scene Counts: Baseline = {{ provenance.period_a.scenes_count }}, Comparison = {{ provenance.period_b.scenes_count if provenance.period_b else 'N/A' }}<br>
    Cloud-Free Valid Area Fraction: {{ (stats.valid_area_fraction * 100) | round(2) }}%<br>
    Software Version: satellite-analyst v{{ software_version }}
  </div>

  <h2>4. Methodological Limitations & Neutrality</h2>
  <div class="caveats">
    <strong>Scientific Caveats:</strong><br>
    1. Water bodies &lt; 0.1 ha (~10 Sentinel-2 pixels) are filtered out to suppress sub-pixel mixed edge noise.<br>
    2. Localized boundary changes along riverbanks or canals are possible contributors (not verified) and must not be cited as confirmed causes without field validation.
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Satellite Analyst • Reproducible, grounded remote sensing analysis • Licensed under MIT
  </div>
</body>
</html>
